{{ 'tessilo-story.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<article class="tessilo-story-page">
  <header class="tessilo-story-page__intro"><h1>A home that lets<br>you be yourself.</h1><p>Not every day needs a grand plan. Sometimes, the best part is coming home, finding your favourite seat, and letting the day slow down.</p></header>
  <figure class="tessilo-story-page__opening"><div class="tessilo-story-frame"><img src="{{ 'tessilo-story-arrival.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A quiet arrival home — Tessilo brand concept" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager"></div><figcaption class="tessilo-story-caption">A Tessilo vision of everyday living. Concept imagery, created to tell our story.</figcaption></figure>
  <section class="tessilo-story-page__chapter tessilo-story-page__chapter--touch"><div><h2>Comfort is<br>something personal.</h2><p>For one person, it is a sofa with room for everyone. For another, it is a chair by the window and one more chapter. The shape of a comfortable home starts with the way you live.</p><p>That is the idea at the heart of Tessilo: a beautiful room should invite you to use it. To sit a little longer. To make space for the people and rituals that matter to you.</p><p>Texture, proportion and the feeling of a room all play a part. Look closely, ask questions, and choose the piece that belongs in your everyday.</p></div><figure><div class="tessilo-story-frame"><img src="{{ 'tessilo-concept-ritual.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="1536" alt="A personal moment with an open book and textured upholstery — concept" loading="lazy"></div></figure></section>
  <section class="tessilo-story-page__rooms"><div><h2>Your life<br>sets the shape.</h2><p>The room where everyone gathers. The corner that is just yours. The place you stretch out at the end of the day. There is more than one way to feel at home.</p></div><nav class="tessilo-story-room-links" aria-label="Find your setting"><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?view=living-room">Room for everyone {{ 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</a><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?view=reading-corner">A moment of your own {{ 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</a><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?view=time-to-unwind">Time to do a little less {{ 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</a></nav></section>
  <section class="tessilo-story-page__chapter tessilo-story-page__chapter--personal"><figure><div class="tessilo-story-frame"><img src="{{ 'tessilo-story-personal.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Room ideas and textile textures on a silver-grey table — design conversation concept" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption class="tessilo-story-caption">An exploration of space and texture. Available finishes and configurations vary by piece.</figcaption></figure><div><h2>Make room<br>for your ideas.</h2><p>A particular arrangement? A colour you keep coming back to? A room with an awkward corner? Start a conversation with us about the home you have in mind.</p><p>Share the piece you are considering, your room measurements and how you want to use the space. We will confirm the available options for that piece, its price and lead time before you order.</p><p>Details matter. Use the original product photographs and dimension drawings as you plan, and ask us to clarify anything you cannot confirm.</p><a class="tessilo-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Tell us about your space</a></div></section>
  <section class="tessilo-story-page__invitation"><h2>Find your place<br>to settle in.</h2><div><p>Start with a feeling. Explore the pieces. Make yourself at home.</p><a class="button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Explore the collection</a></div></section>
</article>
